WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.621
Lesson five. Delicious Food!

2
00:00:04.545 --> 00:00:11.479
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:14.137
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:17.594
Today we learn: Delicious Food! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.155 --> 00:00:22.889
Rice! Say it with me. Rice!

6
00:00:26.827 --> 00:00:29.927
Soup! Say it with me. Soup!

7
00:00:33.985 --> 00:00:37.452
Fish! Say it with me. Fish!

8
00:00:41.387 --> 00:00:44.921
Chicken! Say it with me. Chicken!

9
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.614
Noodles! Say it with me. Noodles!

10
00:00:56.578 --> 00:01:00.395
Vegetable! Say it with me. Vegetable!

11
00:01:04.387 --> 00:01:07.587
Fruit! Say it with me. Fruit!

12
00:01:11.592 --> 00:01:15.142
Dessert! Say it with me. Dessert!

13
00:01:19.174 --> 00:01:24.433
Listen. My favorite food is rice.

14
00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:28.167
Say it with me. My favorite food is rice.

15
00:01:33.006 --> 00:01:39.288
Hot chicken soup is very delicious on a rainy day. I also like noodles with vegetables.

16
00:01:39.338 --> 00:01:40.756
I like this story!

17
00:01:41.822 --> 00:01:47.262
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.312 --> 00:01:48.462
Fish!

19
00:01:49.428 --> 00:01:54.685
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:54.735 --> 00:01:55.885
Vegetable!

21
00:01:56.952 --> 00:02:03.718
Value corner: Patience. Waiting calmly, even when it's difficult, is a wonderful skill.

22
00:02:03.768 --> 00:02:05.466
I can show patience too!

23
00:02:06.207 --> 00:02:13.261
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:13.311 --> 00:02:14.966
Bye-bye, friends!

